 "verdict": "\u26d4 WORLD A IS KILLED: 11 arm(s) sit in the band (0.05, 0.95) in every outer seed \u2014 ['coval_core_2bA', 'coval_core_2bB', 'greedy_k12_fit1', 'oracle_k4_08bR', 'topw_k2', 'topw_k3', 'topw_k4', 'topw_k4_detA', 'topw_k4_detB', 'topw_k6', 'topw_k8'] \u2014 against R978's committed registered band of 4 at N=968. |admitted| is 22.77 [17, 26] across 3000 resamples, point estimate 24. \u2b50 AND R1055's CONTROL IS REPRODUCED AND SHOWN BLIND: varying only the inner bootstrap seed at a fixed prompt sample gives 0 unstable arms, so its `0 unstable` certified the ESTIMATOR's determinism and never the SET."
